## Requirements checklist

- [ ] Output of `run()` numerically matches `impl_torch.run()` within the
      tolerances in `config.yaml`.
- [ ] Handles non-power-of-two tensor sizes with proper masking.
- [ ] `block_size` parameter is respected in fixed (non-autotune) mode.
- [ ] When `autotune=True`, `get_last_config()` returns the selected config.
- [ ] When `autotune=False`, `get_last_config()` returns `None` or a fixed dict.
- [ ] No imports outside: `torch`, `triton`, `triton.language`, `math`, `functools`.
- [ ] The file is completely self-contained — no relative imports.

